    <h1>Turner, ME Dispensary Guide — Androscoggin County 2026</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Three adult-use storefronts on Auburn Road — 45 North, Camp Cannabis, Cworx & Co.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="fact-box">
